            "title": "Free Subscription APP",
            "content": "<p>The WELLFIT APP offers a <strong>free</strong> <strong>subscription</strong> so you can start training right away. Access <strong>real-world running routes</strong>, and interactive features that keep exercise exciting. It also supports Kinomap, Zwift, and <strong>Apple Health</strong>.</p>",
