        "title": "Spec&Size",
        "content": "<p>This compact treadmill supports up to 320 lbs and features a side handrail for added safety. With adjustable speeds up to 6.2 mph, a quiet brushless motor, and vertical storage, it’s perfect for walking and light daily workouts at home or in the office.</p>",
